1) 在采集机上手工 curl -sv \u003c目标URL\u003e 复现:
1) Reproduce it on the collector host with curl -sv <target URL> and separate a connection failure, a timeout and an unexpected status code;
2) For a connection failure, first confirm the target port is reachable and the process is alive;
3) For an unexpected status code, check the target service logs;
4) Verify the probe's timeout, expected status code and certificate verification match reality so the config itself is not causing the alert.

1) 用 echo | openssl s_client -connect \u:
1) Run echo | openssl s_client -connect <domain>:443 -servername <domain> 2>/dev/null | openssl x509 -noout -dates to confirm the expiry date and the issuing chain;
2) If you use ACME/certbot, check the renewal timer and its last run log, and confirm the service was reloaded after renewal;
3) For manually issued certificates, contact the issuer immediately and deploy the new one;
4) After deployment re-run the same openssl command to verify, and confirm every node (including CDN and load balancers) has been updated.
